{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadow of the Matrix</i> is an exhilarating third-person shooter set in a futuristic space environment. Engage in combat against a mysterious enemy systematically disabling the spaceship's vital systems. Can the protagonist save the crew, or will the mission end in disaster? The fate of the voyage rests in your hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/2943d9d02ab556316843562ef8f0d076.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, Earth has been annihilated by a devastating nuclear war. The few survivors escaped aboard the spaceship &quot;Ark,&quot; with passengers placed in biostasis, while a small crew managed operations through robotic avatars connected directly to their nervous systems. The journey proceeded smoothly until the Ark neared its destination\u2014a planet resembling Earth\u2014when critical systems began to fail, endangering all aboard. Only the security officer and a technician codenamed Neurohex awaken. Together, they must confront the threat and save the passengers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/a2f73cece8ea0ad2410a0cb973eb1b07.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle numerous formidable foes using a diverse arsenal, including shotguns and submachine guns. Leverage a variety of combat abilities to shield yourself and inflict devastating damage on enemies. Choose your playstyle and immerse yourself in intense, cinematic firefights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/ef76fe8f5293e4a6957f9cff3e49ad10.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic third-person combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide array of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive, detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping storyline with unexpected twists</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098340?t=1751397807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/654afee0312a1f4665f365d1025d79dc4cdcd639/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751397807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/36a8500f459a96fba915b25137326f6b6b5650ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751397807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/36a8500f459a96fba915b25137326f6b6b5650ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751397807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadow of the Matrix</i> is an exhilarating third-person shooter set in a futuristic space environment. Engage in combat against a mysterious enemy systematically disabling the spaceship's vital systems. Can the protagonist save the crew, or will the mission end in disaster? The fate of the voyage rests in your hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/2943d9d02ab556316843562ef8f0d076.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, Earth has been annihilated by a devastating nuclear war. The few survivors escaped aboard the spaceship &quot;Ark,&quot; with passengers placed in biostasis, while a small crew managed operations through robotic avatars connected directly to their nervous systems. The journey proceeded smoothly until the Ark neared its destination\u2014a planet resembling Earth\u2014when critical systems began to fail, endangering all aboard. Only the security officer and a technician codenamed Neurohex awaken. Together, they must confront the threat and save the passengers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/a2f73cece8ea0ad2410a0cb973eb1b07.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle numerous formidable foes using a diverse arsenal, including shotguns and submachine guns. Leverage a variety of combat abilities to shield yourself and inflict devastating damage on enemies. Choose your playstyle and immerse yourself in intense, cinematic firefights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098340/extras/ef76fe8f5293e4a6957f9cff3e49ad10.avif?t=1751397807\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic third-person combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide array of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive, detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping storyline with unexpected twists</p></li></ul>","developers":["Whale Rock Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strate